{
  "$comment": "The Commerce plugin's returns (RMA), natively: every return newest first or by status, one return (the decision, receiving and restocking, the refund, the note, the label and the timeline), starting a return on an order, and the return settings. Reads the store's own Firestore documents and posts to /api/commerce/returns, as the console does. Grammar: docs/mobile/native-architecture.md section 13.",
